# ============================================================================
#  .assetsignore — files Cloudflare Pages must NOT upload
# ============================================================================
#
#  WHY THIS FILE EXISTS
#  --------------------
#  Pages refuses the whole deployment if ANY single file exceeds 25 MiB. Wrangler
#  reads .gitignore, but Pages asset uploads do not — the first deploy of this
#  project died on:
#
#      Error: Pages only supports files up to 25 MiB in size
#      assets/maps/core2.blend is 89.3 MiB in size
#
#  That .blend is a Blender AUTHORING SOURCE. The map ships as the .glb beside
#  it (assets/maps/TL_core2.glb, 2.9 MB) and nothing in the browser ever fetches
#  the .blend — every ".blend" in the JavaScript is THREE.AdditiveBlending, a
#  material property, not a file path.
#
#  It is ignored here rather than deleted. Deleting somebody's 89 MB source file
#  to make a deploy go through is not a call an automated tool should make.
#
#  EVERYTHING BELOW IS SAFE TO EXCLUDE
#  -----------------------------------
#  None of it is referenced by index.html or by any script the game loads. If
#  something here ever turns out to be needed, the game will 404 on it in the
#  same way a missing file always has, and it will be obvious.
# ============================================================================

# Blender authoring sources. See above: 89 MB, never fetched, breaks the limit.
*.blend

# Editor scratch. Original FBX imports, kept for the map editor's own reloads
# and for re-export. The shipped geometry is the .glb under assets/.
uploads/

# A corrupt 2026-09-05 repository snapshot: 2,289 files, 203 MB, kept only as
# evidence that the tree object is unrecoverable. Git is the real backup.
.git-corrupt/
.git/

# Tooling. Wrangler, miniflare state, build helpers.
node_modules/
.wrangler/
tools/
.vscode/

# Stale duplicate of the game tree and its build output.
dist/
cf-dist/

# Accounts setup documentation and the test suite. Neither is served, and the
# test folder contains a copy of lib-auth.js that must never be mistaken for
# the real one.
test/
ACCOUNTS-SETUP.md
*.md

# Old, no-longer-used account worker. It backed the KV-based system that D1 has
# replaced. The clan registry still lives here — see js/config.js CLAN_API_URL —
# so this is EXCLUDED FROM THE UPLOAD ONLY, not deleted.
clan-api-worker/
matchmaking-worker/

# Scratch from profiling and local testing.
_edgeprof/
_edgeprof3/
*.log
*.err

# Editor and OS noise.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.tmp